  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ちゃのみちを　きわめきれず　しんださどうかの　むねんが　まっちゃに　やどりポケモンになったらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "다도의 길을 통달하지 못한 채 죽은 다도가의 원통함이 말차에 깃들어서 포켓몬이 되었다고 한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "據說是未能將茶道鑽研到極致就死去的茶道家的悔恨附在抹茶上，於是就成為了寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon serait l’incarnation, sous la forme d’un pot de matcha, des regrets d’une personne décédée avant d’avoir maîtrisé l’art du thé.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es soll entstanden sein, als ein Teemeister starb, bevor er sein Handwerk perfektioniert hatte, und sein Gram von einer Tasse Matcha Besitz ergriff.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Según se dice, el resquemor de un practicante de la ceremonia del té que murió sin perfeccionar el arte poseyó el matcha y dio lugar a un Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pare sia nato quando un barattolo di matcha è stato posseduto dal dolore di un cultore della cerimonia del tè morto senza padroneggiarla.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Supposedly, the regrets of a tea ceremony master who died before perfecting his craft lingered in some matcha and became a Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "茶の道を　極めきれず　死んだ茶道家の　無念が　抹茶に　宿りポケモンになったらしい。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "据说是死前未能在茶道上登峰造极的茶道家的遗恨附到抹茶上所变成的宝可梦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Según se dice, el resquemor de un practicante de la ceremonia del té que murió sin perfeccionar el arte poseyó el matcha y dio lugar a un Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ヤバチャの　リージョンフォームにみえるが　まったく　かんけいのないポケモンと　さいきん　はんめいした。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "데인차의 리전폼처럼 보이지만 최근 전혀 상관없는 포켓몬이라고 밝혀졌다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雖然這種寶可夢看起來像是來悲茶的地區型態，但最近被發現其實兩者毫無關係。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On pourrait le prendre pour une forme régionale de Théffroi, mais des recherches ont récemment démontré l’absence de lien entre ces Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es sieht aus wie eine Regionalform von Fatalitee, doch vor Kurzem fand man heraus, dass zwischen den beiden Pokémon keine Verbindung besteht.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si bien parece una forma regional de Sinistea, recientemente se ha demostrado que ambos Pokémon no guardan ninguna relación entre sí.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Può sembrare una forma regionale di Sinistea, ma di recente si è scoperto che non c’è alcuna relazione fra questi due Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Poltchageist looks like a regional form of Sinistea, but it was recently discovered that the two Pokémon are entirely unrelated.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ヤバチャの　リージョンフォームに見えるが　まったく　関係のないポケモンと　最近　判明した。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "看似是来悲茶的地区形态，但最近被发现其实两者之间毫无关系。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si bien parece una forma regional de Sinistea, recientemente se ha demostrado que ambos Pokémon no guardan ninguna relación entre sí.",
